OL,3,GNEWSAMy brother died suddenly in his
OL,4,Asleep - the pain never goes away
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who lost his brother suddenly
OL,7,Fafter a seizure in his sleep has said
OL,8,Fthe pain "never really goes away".
OL,10,FMatt Harris, 33, from Bromsgrove,
OL,11,FWorcestershire, had lived with seizures
OL,12,Ffor nearly 20 years before he died from
OL,13,FSudden Unexpected Death In Epilepsy
OL,14,F(SUDEP) in 2021.
OL,16,F"The sadness of it never really goes
OL,17,Faway. When we do family stuff...
OL,18,Fthere's always someone missing," said
OL,19,Fhis brother Pete Harris, 41.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
